setDefaults
⍝ Establish defaults - Looking forward to ⎕VGET

 'MAXLOG'       default 2000
 'LOGMODES'     default ⎕A ⍝ Log everything (see Log)
 ⍝ LOGFILE could previously only be set from APL, so a host application launched
 ⍝ from a shortcut had no way to reach it and the trace only ever went to the
 ⍝ session window. Fall back to the EWCLOGFILE environment variable, which is
 ⍝ settable at launch. GetEnvironment yields '' when unset, i.e. the old default.
 'LOGFILE'      default (2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' 'EWCLOGFILE')
 'RESOURCES'    default 1 2⍴⊂''
 'PORT'         default 22322
 'MAXSESSIONS'  default 100
 'BREAK'        default ⍬ ⍬ ⍝ IDs Events
 'SHOWDEVTOOLS' default 0
 'FONTMAP'      default FontMap
